      One row per report. Company name/address, logo and the Red/Green signature already set above are reused for every row.<br><br>
      Expected columns (header names are flexible, case-insensitive): <b>Result</b> (Red/Green), <b>Case RefNo</b>, <b>Verification Date</b>, <b>Name</b>, <b>Father's Name</b>, <b>Date of Birth</b>, <b>Address</b>, <b>Alternate Address</b>, and for Red rows: <b>Case Number</b>, <b>Court</b>, <b>State</b>, <b>District</b>, <b>Act & Section</b>, <b>Case Type</b>, <b>Filing Date</b>, <b>Petitioner</b>, <b>Respondent</b>, <b>Respondent Line 2</b>, <b>Status</b>, <b>Nature of Disposal</b>, <b>Disposed of Date</b>, <b>Match Summary</b>, <b>Risk Summary</b>, <b>Order Summary</b>.
